#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:5388
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Zurück"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2447
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Talk to Kent's brother"
msgstr "Mit Kents Bruder reden"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2452
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"Kent? You made it out of the Kraylor base? We thought you were going to "
"spend the rest of your life there. Thank you, captain, for helping Kent get "
"out of there."
msgstr ""
"Kent? Du hast es aus der Kraylor-Basis geschafft? Wir dachten, du würdest "
"den Rest deines Lebens dort verbringen! Danke, Captain, dass Sie Kent "
"geholfen haben, da rauszukommen."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2458
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Can you help us with beam weapon repair?"
msgstr "Können Sie uns mit der Reparatur der Laserwaffen helfen?"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2464
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"For the Repulse class? Absolutely. I used to work on those all the time."
msgstr ""
"Für eine Repulse-Klasse? Kein Problem, daran habe ich früher ständig "
"gearbeitet."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2479 scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2549
#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3040 scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3124
#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3204
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Danke"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2484
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"You're quite welcome. While I was in there, I fixed up your beams so they "
"could function at maximum potential."
msgstr ""
"Wirklich gerne geschehen. So, die Laser sind repariert und sie sollten jetzt "
"optimal funktionieren."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2494
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Then double thanks!"
msgstr "Dann nochmals vielen Dank!"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2503
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Thank *you* for getting my brother out of that Kraylor prison."
msgstr ""
"Ich habe zu danken, dass sie meinen Bruder aus diesem Kraylor-Gefängnis "
"rausgeholt haben."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2526
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Talk to Edwina's father"
msgstr "Mit Edwinas Vater reden"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2531
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"I am glad to hear that Edwina escaped that prison. We were worried about her."
msgstr ""
"Ich bin so froh zu hören, das Edwina aus diesem Gefängnis entkommen konnte. "
"Wir hatten uns große Sorgen gemacht."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2537
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Edwina says you do missile systems repair work"
msgstr "Edwina sagte, Sie reparieren Raketensysteme?"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2543
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Should be easy enough. I'm grateful to you for helping Edwina escape."
msgstr ""
"Sollte kein Problem sein. Ich bin so dankbar, dass Sie Edwina bei der Flucht "
"geholfen haben."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2554
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "You're quite welcome."
msgstr "Wirklich gern geschehen."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2571
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Talk to Johnny"
msgstr "Mit Johnny reden"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2575
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Mom? Wow, I thought you were toast. Good to hear your voice."
msgstr "Mom? Wow, ich dachte du wärst Toast. Gut, deine Stimme zu hören!"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2581
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Can you get our impulse drive working better?"
msgstr "Können Sie unseren Impulsantrieb ein wenig aufrüsten?"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2636
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Piece of cake. Thanks for the %s."
msgstr "Kinderspiel, danke für die Sachen(%s)."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2647 scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2677
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Thank you"
msgstr "Danke!"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2652 scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2682
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Sure, Mom. I'll see you at Christmas."
msgstr "Klar Mom, Wir sehen uns an Weihnachten!"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2664
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Piece of cake, but I'll need %s."
msgstr "Kinderspiel, aber ich benötige: %s."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2672
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Piece of cake."
msgstr "Kinderspiel."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2700
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Talk to Nancy's brother"
msgstr "Mit Nancys Bruder reden"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2705
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"Nancy! Last I heard, your ship had been captured by Kraylors and you were "
"imprisoned. Good to know you won't be stuck there forever. What brings you "
"here?"
msgstr ""
"Nancy! Das Letzte was ich hörte war, dass dein Schiff von den Kraylor "
"gekapert wurde und du gefangen genommen wurdest. Gut zu wissen, dass du dort "
"nicht ewig festsitzt. Was führt Euch hierher?"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2711
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Our jump drive needs some tuning"
msgstr "Unser Sprungantrieb braucht ein wenig Tuning"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2769
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"That should not be hard to do. I could probably do that in my sleep. Thanks "
"for bringing %s."
msgstr "Kein Ding, das mach ich im Schlaf. Danke für die Sachen. (%s) "

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2783 scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2821
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Thanks, bro"
msgstr "Danke, Bro"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2788 scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2826
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"No problem. Treat your jump drive right and it'll always bring you home."
msgstr ""
"Kein Problem. Behandelt euren Sprungantrieb gut und er wird euch immer nach "
"Hause bringen."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2805
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"That should not be hard to do. I could probably do that in my sleep. But "
"I'll need some %s."
msgstr "Kein Ding, das mach ich im Schlaf. Allerdings brauche ich etwas %s."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2815
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "That should not be hard to do. I could probably do that in my sleep."
msgstr "Kein Ding, das mach ich im Schlaf."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2845
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Talk to Manuel's cousin"
msgstr "Mit Manuels Cousin reden"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2850
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"Yo Manuel, why you want to scare us by getting captured, man? At least you "
"escaped. Why you here?"
msgstr ""
"Yo Manuel, warum machst du uns Angst, indem du dich gefangen nehmen lässt, "
"Mann? Wenigstens bist du entkommen. Was treibt dich hierher?"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2856
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "The reactor is weak... real weak"
msgstr "Unser Reaktor ist schwach.. sehr schwach."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2862
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Lemme see if I can get it to charge up right."
msgstr "Lass mich mal sehen ob ich ihn ein wenig aufmotzen kann."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2870
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "The captain would appreciate it"
msgstr "Das würden wir wirklich sehr zu schätzen wissen."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2876
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"You're all set. Don't overheat the reactor or you'll get a nasty surprise."
msgstr ""
"Das war's schon. Achtet darauf, den Reaktor nicht zu überhitzen, sonst "
"erlebt ihr eine böse Überraschung."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2894
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Talk to Fred's wife"
msgstr "Mit Freds Frau sprechen"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2899
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Fred! You escaped! We were worried sick."
msgstr "Fred! Du bist entkommen! Wir waren krank vor Sorge!"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2905
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "We need to connect to the Human Navy network"
msgstr "Wir müssten uns mit dem Netzwerk der menschlichen Navy verbinden"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2911
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"I can do that for you. However, that means you'll go from being Independent "
"to being in the Human Navy."
msgstr ""
"Das kann ich machen. Das würde allerdings bedeuten dass das Schiff ab sofort "
"nicht mehr als unabhängig gilt, sondern als \"menschliche Navy\" registriert "
"ist."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:2917
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "I understand the consequences. Please proceed"
msgstr "Die Konsequenzen sind mir bewusst. Bitte fahren Sie fort."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3036
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "You're all fixed up."
msgstr "Alles erledigt. Ihre Kommunikation ist wieder vollständig hergestellt."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3045
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "You're welcome. Fred, honey, I'll see you after you get off work."
msgstr "Gern geschehen. Fred, Schatz, ich seh' Dich dann nach der Arbeit."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3063
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "I'll check with the captain and get back to you"
msgstr "Ich sprech' das noch mit Cap und der Crew ab und melde mich bei Dir!"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3067
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "OK."
msgstr "Okay."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3086 scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3280
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Talk to Amir's sister"
msgstr "Mit Amirs Schwester reden"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3092
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Welcome to %s! Any friend of Amir's is a friend of mine."
msgstr ""
"Willkommen auf der Station \"%s\"! Freunde von Amir sind auch meine Freunde."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3100
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Can you help us with our shields?"
msgstr "Können Sie uns bei unseren Schilden helfen?"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3106
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"Yes, I can. However, I can only help with one: front or rear. I need more "
"parts to do both."
msgstr ""
"Ja, das kann ich. ich kann aber leider nur mit einem Schildsystem helfen, "
"Front oder Heck. Für beides habe ich leider nicht genügend Ersatzteile."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3110
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Repair front shield"
msgstr "Frontschilde reparieren"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3115
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"Your front shields are now fully operational. Your repair crew can finish "
"the rest."
msgstr ""
"Ihre Frontschilde sind nun voll funktionsfähig, Ihre Reparaturcrew kann nun "
"den Rest erledigen."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3171
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"Certainly. Bring back %s to get the rear shield fixed. You might find some "
"at %s."
msgstr ""
"Sicher. Bitte bringen sie \"%s\" damit ich die Heckschilde reparieren kann. "
"In %s sollte etwas davon vorrätig sein."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3190
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Repair rear shield"
msgstr "Heckschilde reparieren"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3195
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"Your rear shields are now fully operational. Your repair crew can finish the "
"rest."
msgstr ""
"Ihre Heckschilde sind nun voll funktionsfähig. Ihr Reparaturteam kann den "
"Rest erledigen."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3251
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"Certainly. Bring back %s to get the front shield fixed. You might find some "
"at %s."
msgstr ""
"Sicher. Bitte bringen sie \"%s\" damit ich die Frontschilde reparieren kann. "
"In %s sollte etwas davon vorrätig sein."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3286
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid ""
"Welcome back. Did you bring some %s for me to finish fixing up your shields?"
msgstr ""
"Willkommen zurück. Haben Sie \"%s\" mit gebracht damit ich Ihre Schilde "
"reparieren kann?"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3304
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Yes, please take the %s and fix the shields"
msgstr "Ja, hier sind die Sachen (%s), bitte reparieren Sie unsere Schilde."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3321
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Front shield fully functional."
msgstr "Frontschilde voll funktionsfähig."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3333
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Rear shield fully functional."
msgstr "Heckschilde voll funktionsfähig."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3344
#, lua-format
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "Oops, no %s aboard"
msgstr "Oops, kein \"%s\" an Bord"

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3349
msgctxt "crewFriends-comms"
msgid "OK, good luck."
msgstr "Okay, viel Glück."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3362 scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:4320
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "Tell me more about your station"
msgstr "Erzählen Sie mir mehr über Ihre Station."

#: scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:3365 scripts/scenario_39_escape.lua:4323
msgctxt "station-comms"
msgid "What would you like to know?"
msgstr "Was würden Sie gerne wissen?"

